**The Job**

We are looking for a Creative Director Product to lead and shape the future of our product categories across some of the most relevant global A-brands in sport and fashion.

As a trusted long-term licensing partner, we have built global brand collaborations over decades — translating brand DNA into commercially successful, consumer-relevant products at scale. This role sits at the heart of that model: connecting brand vision, creative direction, and exceptional product execution.

You will define a clear product vision, inspire your team, and translate global brand strategies into standout category concepts — from technically advanced first-layer products (socks, bodywear & underwear) to high-impact fanwear collections linked to the world’s leading teams and assets.

**Your Mission**

* Define and drive a creative product strategy and long-term vision across all categories;
* Translate brand and company strategy into compelling product concepts and seasonal roadmaps;
* Bring brand DNA and storytelling to life through commercially relevant product design;
* Lead the development of technically strong, best-in-class first-layer products;
* Drive product execution at scale, delivering high-volume, commercially successful assortments;
* Ensure products deliver on best price–value ratio, balancing design, quality and cost;
* Anticipate and translate consumer needs and trends into relevant assortments;
* Ensure we are present where the consumer shops, delivering the right product for the right channel;

Fanwear (integrated scope):


* Lead the creation of fanwear collections for top-tier teams, translating partnerships into commercially successful products;
* Operate within a triangle partnership model (brand – team – stichd) to ensure strong alignment and execution;
* Drive fast, responsive product execution around key moments, turning speed into a differentiator ;
* Translate real-time consumer insights (e.g. trackside, DTC) into scalable products that meet fan expectations;
* Build focused assortments and capsule drops that drive engagement, conversion and sell-through.

**Your Talent**

You bring the creative vision, product instinct and commercial sharpness to shape collections that move at the speed of culture — and perform in the real world.




